@@ -0,0 +1,312 @@
+/*
+	Arabic for Dear ImGui, which draws code points left to right as they come: letters are
+	replaced by their contextual presentation forms (isolated, final, initial, medial; lam-alef
+	ligatures) and every line is put in visual order (right-to-left runs reversed, runs of Latin
+	text and numbers kept as they are, brackets mirrored).
+
