@@ -0,0 +1,722 @@
+/*
+	Resonance's opening, played once when the app starts: Sonic spin-dashes into the spotlight as a
+	ball, skids to the middle of the stage and hops up as the Dreamcast drops out of the sky, uncurls
+	and catches it (the trophy catch at the end of a Crash Team Racing cup), lands; confetti, light
+	rays, the name.
+
+	The pictures are cut from one illustration by scripts/make-resonance-art.py
+	(/app0/launcher/intro: the arena, Sonic holding the console, the console alone, and layout.txt
+	with where each sits in the illustration). The ball is drawn with the fur of Sonic.s head.
+	Any button skips.
+
