@@ -0,0 +1,242 @@
+/*
+	Resonance's PS3 look, shared by the Cross bar, the settings and the quick menu: the month's
+	colour (the PS3 changes it every month), the slow wave, white text with a soft shadow, the
+	clock, button hints, items with an icon and a title. And the pad as menus read it.
+
+	This file is part of Flycast.
+
