+/*
+	Resonance: games on network shares. NFS (libnfs: a NAS, WinNFSd on a PC) and SMB2/3 (libsmb2: a
+	shared Windows folder, Samba) behind Flycast's storage layer (hostfs::customStorage), so the
+	library scanner and the disc readers use them like folders: nfs://<label>/<path>,
+	smb://<label>/<path>. A share's server, folder and login are in emu.cfg ([resonance]
+	NetShareN); its label is all that appears in paths.
+
+	This file is part of Flycast.
+
